%% LangGraph compile flow for MTS.
%% Regenerate with: python -c "from app.graph.builder import mermaid_diagram; print(mermaid_diagram())"
flowchart TD
    START([__start__]) --> intake
    intake -->|clean command| plan
    intake -->|ambiguous| clarify
    intake -->|unknown area / no clearance| reject
    plan --> validate
    validate -->|no violations| critique
    validate -->|violations & repair_attempts < 3| repair
    validate -->|violations & repair_attempts >= 3| reject
    validate -->|planner asked to clarify| clarify
    critique --> advisor
    advisor --> finalize
    repair --> plan
    clarify --> finalize
    reject --> finalize
    finalize --> END([__end__])
